    {"type": "text", "id": "entry_text", "x": 205, "y": 175, "width": 270, "height": 110, "text": "[1] ENTRY LAYER\n\nCLI(main.py) -> 命令行参数解析\nStudio(Home.py) -> Streamlit Web入口\nFrontend(app.py) -> 多标签页应用", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "entry", "originalText": "[1] ENTRY LAYER\n\nCLI(main.py) -> 命令行参数解析\nStudio(Home.py) -> Streamlit Web入口\nFrontend(app.py) -> 多标签页应用", "autoResize": true},
    {"type": "arrow", "id": "arr_to_entry", "x": 500, "y": 190, "width": 230, "height": -80, "points": [[0,0],[230,-80]], "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "strokeWidth": 2, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "entry", "fixedPoint": [0, 0.2]}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "root", "fixedPoint": [0, 0.5]}, "boundElements": [{"id": "arr_entry_label", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "arr_entry_label", "x": 400, "y": 145, "width": 80, "height": 20, "text": "用户输入", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "arr_to_entry", "originalText": "用户输入", "autoResize": true},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "orch", "x": 520, "y": 170, "width": 420, "height": 120, "backgroundColor": "#1e3a5f", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "orch_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_to_orch", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arr_orch_to_mgr", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "orch_text", "x": 525, "y": 175, "width": 410, "height": 110, "text": "[2] ORCHESTRATION (core/)\n\nTNBCSimulacrum(agent.py) -> 主编排器，协调所有子系统\nEventBus(event_bus.py) -> Pub/Sub解耦，40+事件类型\nStateSchema -> tum_*(肿瘤) imm_*(免疫) crna_*(circRNA) 共170+键\nConfig -> TumorConfig/RxConfig/Confluencia3Config 12个dataclass", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "orch", "originalText": "[2] ORCHESTRATION (core/)\n\nTNBCSimulacrum(agent.py) -> 主编排器，协调所有子系统\nEventBus(event_bus.py) -> Pub/Sub解耦，40+事件类型\nStateSchema -> tum_*(肿瘤) imm_*(免疫) crna_*(circRNA) 共170+键\nConfig -> TumorConfig/RxConfig/Confluencia3Config 12个dataclass", "autoResize": true},
