    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "tme", "x": 400, "y": 460, "width": 350, "height": 250, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d2e", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "tme_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_mgr_to_tme", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arr_tme_to_mgr", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "tme_text", "x": 405, "y": 465, "width": 340, "height": 240, "text": "[5] TME SUBSYSTEM (tme/) - TMEManager\n\nImmuneDynamics(immune_dynamics.py)\n  imm_cd8_count: CD8+ T细胞计数\n  imm_cd4_count: CD4+ T细胞计数\n  imm_nk_activity: NK细胞活性\n  imm_treg_ratio: Treg抑制比例\n\nImmuneEvasion(immune_evasion.py)\n  evs_pd_l1_level: PD-L1表达水平\n  evs_mhc_i_down: MHC-I下调程度\n  evs_checkpoint_expr: 免疫检查点表达\n\nImmunoediting(immunoediting.py)\n  ied_phase: 消除/平衡/逃逸阶段\n  ied_escape_prob: 逃逸概率\n\nFibroblast(fibroblast.py)\n  caf_activation: CAF激活状态\n  caf_ecm_density: ECM密度", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "tme", "originalText": "[5] TME SUBSYSTEM (tme/) - TMEManager\n\nImmuneDynamics(immune_dynamics.py)\n  imm_cd8_count: CD8+ T细胞计数\n  imm_cd4_count: CD4+ T细胞计数\n  imm_nk_activity: NK细胞活性\n  imm_treg_ratio: Treg抑制比例\n\nImmuneEvasion(immune_evasion.py)\n  evs_pd_l1_level: PD-L1表达水平\n  evs_mhc_i_down: MHC-I下调程度\n  evs_checkpoint_expr: 免疫检查点表达\n\nImmunoediting(immunoediting.py)\n  ied_phase: 消除/平衡/逃逸阶段\n  ied_escape_prob: 逃逸概率\n\nFibroblast(fibroblast.py)\n  caf_activation: CAF激活状态\n  caf_ecm_density: ECM密度", "autoResize": true},
    {"type": "arrow", "id": "arr_mgr_to_tme", "x": 730, "y": 370, "width": 330, "height": 90, "points": [[0,0],[-330,90]], "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "strokeWidth": 2, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "mgr", "fixedPoint": [0.2, 1]}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "tme", "fixedPoint": [1, 0]}, "boundElements": [{"id": "arr_m_tm_label", "type": "text"}]},
