    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "rx", "x": 780, "y": 460, "width": 350, "height": 250, "backgroundColor": "#2d1b69", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#8b5cf6", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "rx_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_mgr_to_rx", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arr_rx_to_mgr", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "rx_text", "x": 785, "y": 465, "width": 340, "height": 240, "text": "[6] TREATMENT (treatment/) - TreatmentManager\n\nChemotherapy(chemo.py)\n  drg_chemo_conc: 化疗药物浓度\n  drg_chemo_kill: 细胞杀伤率\n\nImmunotherapy(immuno.py)\n  drg_immuno_block: PD-1/CTLA-4阻断率\n  drg_immuno_boost: 免疫增强因子\n\nTargeted(target.py)\n  drg_parp_inhibit: PARP抑制剂效果\n  drg_akt_inhibit: AKT通路抑制\n\nRadiotherapy(radio.py)\n  drg_radio_dose: 辐射剂量(Gy)\n  drg_abscopal: 远隔效应强度\n\nCircRNATherapy*(circrna_rx.py)\n  drg_crna_delivered: circRNA载体剂量\n  drg_crna_expression: 蛋白表达水平", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "rx", "originalText": "[6] TREATMENT (treatment/) - TreatmentManager\n\nChemotherapy(chemo.py)\n  drg_chemo_conc: 化疗药物浓度\n  drg_chemo_kill: 细胞杀伤率\n\nImmunotherapy(immuno.py)\n  drg_immuno_block: PD-1/CTLA-4阻断率\n  drg_immuno_boost: 免疫增强因子\n\nTargeted(target.py)\n  drg_parp_inhibit: PARP抑制剂效果\n  drg_akt_inhibit: AKT通路抑制\n\nRadiotherapy(radio.py)\n  drg_radio_dose: 辐射剂量(Gy)\n  drg_abscopal: 远隔效应强度\n\nCircRNATherapy*(circrna_rx.py)\n  drg_crna_delivered: circRNA载体剂量\n  drg_crna_expression: 蛋白表达水平", "autoResize": true},
    {"type": "arrow", "id": "arr_mgr_to_rx", "x": 840, "y": 420, "width": 0, "height": 40, "points": [[0,0],[0,40]], "strokeColor": "#8b5cf6", "strokeWidth": 2, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "mgr", "fixedPoint": [0.5, 1]}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "rx", "fixedPoint": [0.5, 0]}, "boundElements": [{"id": "arr_m_r_label", "type": "text"}]},
