    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "crna", "x": 1160, "y": 320, "width": 400, "height": 450, "backgroundColor": "#5c3d1a", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "boundElements": [{"id": "crna_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_mgr_to_crna", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arr_crna_to_mgr", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "arr_crna_to_torus", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "crna_text", "x": 1165, "y": 325, "width": 390, "height": 440, "text": "[7] CIRCRNA SUBSYSTEM * (circrna/) - CircRNAManager\n\nImmuneSensing(immune_sensing.py)\n  crna_immuno_score: 免疫原性评分(0-1)\n  crna_rig_i_act: RIG-I激活程度\n  crna_tlr_signal: TLR信号强度\n  crna_pkr_phos: PKR磷酸化水平\n\nStructurePred(structure_pred.py)\n  crna_structure_mfe: MFE最小自由能(kcal/mol)\n  crna_bsj_stability: 反向剪接稳定性\n  crna_gc_content: GC含量比例\n\nTorusFoldScorer(torusfold_scorer.py)\n  crna_torus_score: TorusFold结构评分\n  crna_confidence: 预置信度\n\nBSJFeatures(bsj_features.py)\n  crna_bsj_type: BSJ类型\n  crna_flanking_seq: 侧翼序列特征\n\nCircRNAEvolution(cirrna_evo.py)\n  crna_evo_fitness: 进化适应度\n  crna_evo_generation: 进化代数\n\nDrugResponse(drug_resp.py)\n  crna_drug synergy: 与TNBC药物协同效应\n  crna_target_expr: 目标蛋白表达量", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "crna", "originalText": "[7] CIRCRNA SUBSYSTEM * (circrna/) - CircRNAManager\n\nImmuneSensing(immune_sensing.py)\n  crna_immuno_score: 免疫原性评分(0-1)\n  crna_rig_i_act: RIG-I激活程度\n  crna_tlr_signal: TLR信号强度\n  crna_pkr_phos: PKR磷酸化水平\n\nStructurePred(structure_pred.py)\n  crna_structure_mfe: MFE最小自由能(kcal/mol)\n  crna_bsj_stability: 反向剪接稳定性\n  crna_gc_content: GC含量比例\n\nTorusFoldScorer(torusfold_scorer.py)\n  crna_torus_score: TorusFold结构评分\n  crna_confidence: 预置信度\n\nBSJFeatures(bsj_features.py)\n  crna_bsj_type: BSJ类型\n  crna_flanking_seq: 侧翼序列特征\n\nCircRNAEvolution(cirrna_evo.py)\n  crna_evo_fitness: 进化适应度\n  crna_evo_generation: 进化代数\n\nDrugResponse(drug_resp.py)\n  crna_drug synergy: 与TNBC药物协同效应\n  crna_target_expr: 目标蛋白表达量", "autoResize": true},
