    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "torus", "x": 1160, "y": 800, "width": 400, "height": 150, "backgroundColor": "#ec4899", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#ec4899", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "torus_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_crna_to_torus", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "torus_text", "x": 1165, "y": 805, "width": 390, "height": 140, "text": "[8] TORUSFOLD DL (torusfold/) - 深度学习结构预测\n\n5种预测模式:\n  heuristic: 启发式快速推断(无GPU)\n  simple: MDS坐标降维\n  diffusion: AlphaFold3风格扩散模型\n  physics_b: 几何约束求解器\n  physics_ba: 几何约束 + OpenMM分子动力学精修\n\n输出:\n  3D坐标预测 + confidence置信度\n  与ViennaRNA二级结构互补", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#1a1b26", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "torus", "originalText": "[8] TORUSFOLD DL (torusfold/) - 深度学习结构预测\n\n5种预测模式:\n  heuristic: 启发式快速推断(无GPU)\n  simple: MDS坐标降维\n  diffusion: AlphaFold3风格扩散模型\n  physics_b: 几何约束求解器\n  physics_ba: 几何约束 + OpenMM分子动力学精修\n\n输出:\n  3D坐标预测 + confidence置信度\n  与ViennaRNA二级结构互补", "autoResize": true},
    {"type": "arrow", "id": "arr_crna_to_torus", "x": 1360, "y": 770, "width": 0, "height": 30, "points": [[0,0],[0,30]], "strokeColor": "#ec4899", "strokeWidth": 2, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "crna", "fixedPoint": [0.5, 1]}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "torus", "fixedPoint": [0.5, 0]}, "boundElements": [{"id": "arr_c_t_label", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "arr_c_t_label", "x": 1365, "y": 775, "width": 60, "height": 15, "text": "结构预测", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#ec4899", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "arr_crna_to_torus", "originalText": "结构预测", "autoResize": true},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "bio", "x": 20, "y": 740, "width": 350, "height": 130, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d4d", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#06b6d4", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "bio_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_mgr_to_bio", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "bio_text", "x": 25, "y": 745, "width": 340, "height": 120, "text": "[9] BIOMARKER (biomarker/) - BiomarkerManager\n\nBiomarkerTracker(tracker.py)\n  bio_pd_l1_cps: PD-L1 CPS评分(0-100)\n  bio_til_density: TIL浸润密度\n\nSubtypeClassifier(subtype.py)\n  bio_subtype: BLIS/IM/M/LAR四亚型\n  bio_subtype_prob: 各亚型概率\n\nResistanceDetector(resistance.py)\n  bio_resistance_sig: 耐药签名表达\n  bio_resistance_prob: 耐药概率", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "bio", "originalText": "[9] BIOMARKER (biomarker/) - BiomarkerManager\n\nBiomarkerTracker(tracker.py)\n  bio_pd_l1_cps: PD-L1 CPS评分(0-100)\n  bio_til_density: TIL浸润密度\n\nSubtypeClassifier(subtype.py)\n  bio_subtype: BLIS/IM/M/LAR四亚型\n  bio_subtype_prob: 各亚型概率\n\nResistanceDetector(resistance.py)\n  bio_resistance_sig: 耐药签名表达\n  bio_resistance_prob: 耐药概率", "autoResize": true},
