    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "clin", "x": 400, "y": 740, "width": 350, "height": 130, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d4d", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#06b6d4", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "clin_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_mgr_to_clin", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "clin_text", "x": 405, "y": 745, "width": 340, "height": 120, "text": "[10] CLINICAL (clinical/) - ClinicalManager\n\nRECISTTracker(recist.py)\n  cli_recist_response: CR/PR/SD/PD疗效\n  cli_tumor_change: 肿瘤变化率\n\nSurvivalModel(survival.py)\n  cli_pfs_months: 无进展生存期\n  cli_os_months: 总生存期\n\nToxicityGrader(toxicity.py)\n  cli_toxicity_grade: CTCAE 5.0分级(0-5)\n  cli_adverse_events: 不良事件列表", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "clin", "originalText": "[10] CLINICAL (clinical/) - ClinicalManager\n\nRECISTTracker(recist.py)\n  cli_recist_response: CR/PR/SD/PD疗效\n  cli_tumor_change: 肿瘤变化率\n\nSurvivalModel(survival.py)\n  cli_pfs_months: 无进展生存期\n  cli_os_months: 总生存期\n\nToxicityGrader(toxicity.py)\n  cli_toxicity_grade: CTCAE 5.0分级(0-5)\n  cli_adverse_events: 不良事件列表", "autoResize": true},
