    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "pk", "x": 780, "y": 740, "width": 350, "height": 130, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d4d", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#06b6d4", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "pk_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_mgr_to_pk", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "pk_text", "x": 785, "y": 745, "width": 340, "height": 120, "text": "[11] PK/PD (pk/) - circRNA专属药代动力学\n\nRNACTM(rnactm.py)\n  crna_pk_auc_efficacy: AUC药效积分\n  crna_pk_peak_protein: 蛋白表达峰值\n  crna_pk_half_life: 半衰期(小时)\n  crna_pk_bioavailability: 生物利用度\n\nBackend选择:\n  rnactm(本地) | external(在线API)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "pk", "originalText": "[11] PK/PD (pk/) - circRNA专属药代动力学\n\nRNACTM(rnactm.py)\n  crna_pk_auc_efficacy: AUC药效积分\n  crna_pk_peak_protein: 蛋白表达峰值\n  crna_pk_half_life: 半衰期(小时)\n  crna_pk_bioavailability: 生物利用度\n\nBackend选择:\n  rnactm(本地) | external(在线API)", "autoResize": true},
