    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "pages", "x": 20, "y": 900, "width": 550, "height": 120, "backgroundColor": "#1e3a5f", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "pages_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_entry_to_pages", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "pages_text", "x": 25, "y": 905, "width": 540, "height": 110, "text": "[15] STUDIO PAGES (streamlit_app/pages/) - 无代码Web界面\n\n1_CircRNA_Analysis.py: 粘贴序列 -> 免疫原性评分 -> 结构预测\n2_Drug_Prediction.py: ADMET预测 -> 药物优化建议\n3_Epitope_Screening.py: MHC表位预测 -> 疫苗设计\n4_TNBC_Simulator.py: 数字孪生仿真 -> 治疗方案模拟\n5_Report_Export.py: JSON/HTML报告生成\n6_Joint_Analysis.py: circRNA + Drug联合分析", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "pages", "originalText": "[15] STUDIO PAGES (streamlit_app/pages/) - 无代码Web界面\n\n1_CircRNA_Analysis.py: 粘贴序列 -> 免疫原性评分 -> 结构预测\n2_Drug_Prediction.py: ADMET预测 -> 药物优化建议\n3_Epitope_Screening.py: MHC表位预测 -> 疫苗设计\n4_TNBC_Simulator.py: 数字孪生仿真 -> 治疗方案模拟\n5_Report_Export.py: JSON/HTML报告生成\n6_Joint_Analysis.py: circRNA + Drug联合分析", "autoResize": true},
