    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "exp", "x": 600, "y": 900, "width": 550, "height": 120, "backgroundColor": "#3a3a3a", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#a0a0a0", "strokeWidth": 2, "boundElements": [{"id": "exp_text", "type": "text"}, {"id": "arr_mgr_to_exp", "type": "arrow"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "exp_text", "x": 605, "y": 905, "width": 540, "height": 110, "text": "[14] EXPERIMENTS (experiments/) - 14个实验模板\n\nexperiment_akt_pi3k.py: AKT/PI3K通路抑制实验\nexperiment_parp_brca.py: PARP/BRCA合成致死实验\nexperiment_circrna_therapy.py: circRNA治疗验证实验\nexperiment_subtype_comparison.py: 四亚型对比实验\nexperiment_combination_*.py: 联合治疗实验\nexperiment_resistance_evolution.py: 耐药演化追踪\n+ 8个更多实验模板...", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "exp", "originalText": "[14] EXPERIMENTS (experiments/) - 14个实验模板\n\nexperiment_akt_pi3k.py: AKT/PI3K通路抑制实验\nexperiment_parp_brca.py: PARP/BRCA合成致死实验\nexperiment_circrna_therapy.py: circRNA治疗验证实验\nexperiment_subtype_comparison.py: 四亚型对比实验\nexperiment_combination_*.py: 联合治疗实验\nexperiment_resistance_evolution.py: 耐药演化追踪\n+ 8个更多实验模板...", "autoResize": true},
