    {"type": "text", "id": "enc_text", "x": 1185, "y": 1095, "width": 370, "height": 70, "text": "[13] ENCODER (encoder/) - RNA序列编码\n\nRNATransformer(model.py): BERT-style编码器\nTokenizer(tokenizer.py): K-mer分词器\n预训练embedding用于下游任务", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "enc", "originalText": "[13] ENCODER (encoder/) - RNA序列编码\n\nRNATransformer(model.py): BERT-style编码器\nTokenizer(tokenizer.py): K-mer分词器\n预训练embedding用于下游任务", "autoResize": true},
